00:55:43.850 --> 00:55:58.890
<v Ira Glass>Special thanks today to Brent Sayers and Charlotte Taillor. Our website, thisamericanlife.org, where you can listen to our archive of over 600 episodes for absolutely free. This American Life is delivered to public radio stations by PRX, the Public Radio Exchange.

00:55:58.890 --> 00:56:10.260
<v Ira Glass>Thanks, as always, to our program's co-founder Mr. Torey Malatia. You know, we were watching The Matrix, and I look over at him, and he's cheering for the robots! For the robots! He explains to me later--

00:56:10.260 --> 00:56:12.010
<v Caroline>I think we're just very different people.

